### BTH5 API tests. Requires BTH3 :8081 and BTH4 :8082 running.
### Replace 3 with a real product ID from GET http://localhost:8081/products
@reportUrl = http://localhost:8083
@productId = 3

### 1) Check report list (starts empty)
GET {{reportUrl}}/reports

### 2) Set cost price (VND) for product; do NOT confuse with selling price
PUT {{reportUrl}}/costs/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "unitCost": 14000000 }

### 3) View the cost catalog
GET {{reportUrl}}/costs

### 4) Create new snapshot from BTH3 and BTH4 (completed orders only count as sold)
POST {{reportUrl}}/reports/generate

### 5) Latest report, including product and order breakdown
GET {{reportUrl}}/reports/latest

### 6) Per-product report
GET {{reportUrl}}/reports/products

### 7) Per-order report
GET {{reportUrl}}/reports/orders

### 8) Report history and historical report by ID
GET {{reportUrl}}/reports

### Substitute report ID from previous response for 1
GET {{reportUrl}}/reports/1

GET {{reportUrl}}/reports/1/products

GET {{reportUrl}}/reports/1/orders
